**New chapters**: {{NEW_CHAPTERS_OR_NONE}}
<!-- e.g. "31-auth-flow.md" or "none" -->

**Unchanged chapters**: {{UNCHANGED_COUNT}} of {{TOTAL_COUNT}}

**Warnings / open points raised by sub-agents**:

{{WARNINGS_OR_NONE}}
